                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-emerald-400"></i> T8: <strong class="text-emerald-300 font-bold" id="pctqBannerT8">0 ₫</strong></span>
                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-amber-400"></i> T9: <strong class="text-amber-300 font-bold" id="pctqBannerT9">0 ₫</strong></span>
